// Leaf: Initialise
// Retail: Fable.exe (TLC, VC7.1) @ 0x00A755C0, 174 bytes, `ret 0xc`.
// Callees: CMovableResourceMemoryPool::AllocateResource(long*, CMovableResource*, ulong, ulong) 0x00A62E40,
